Below is a progressive series of exploratory BigQuery SQL statements (≤ 10) that lead from very simple look-ups to the final query that delivers the requested result set.  
Every query is wrapped in a single code block and ends with `LIMIT 20` (except the last one, which shows only the top-3 rows).  

```sql
--Description: Find the Targetome drugID(s) that correspond to “sorafenib”.
SELECT DISTINCT `drugID`, `synonym`
FROM `isb-cgc-bq.targetome_versioned.drug_synonyms_v1`
WHERE LOWER(`synonym`) LIKE '%sorafenib%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: Preview Targetome interactions that involve those sorafenib drugID(s).
SELECT DISTINCT `interactionID`, `drugID`, `targetID`, `targetName`,
       `target_uniprotID`
FROM `isb-cgc-bq.targetome_versioned.interactions_v1`
WHERE `drugID` IN (
  SELECT DISTINCT `drugID`
  FROM `isb-cgc-bq.targetome_versioned.drug_synonyms_v1`
  WHERE LOWER(`synonym`) LIKE '%sorafenib%'
)
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: Inspect the experimental assay values attached to the sorafenib interactions.
SELECT i.`interactionID`, e.`expID`, e.`exp_assayType`,
       e.`exp_assayValueLow`, e.`exp_assayValueMedian`,
       e.`exp_assayValueHigh`, e.`exp_assayUnits`
FROM `isb-cgc-bq.targetome_versioned.interactions_v1` AS i
JOIN `isb-cgc-bq.targetome_versioned.experiments_v1`  AS e
  ON i.`expID` = e.`expID`
WHERE i.`drugID` IN (
  SELECT DISTINCT `drugID`
  FROM `isb-cgc-bq.targetome_versioned.drug_synonyms_v1`
  WHERE LOWER(`synonym`) LIKE '%sorafenib%'
)
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: List sorafenib target UniProt IDs that meet the ≤ 100 nM criteria.
SELECT DISTINCT i.`target_uniprotID`
FROM `isb-cgc-bq.targetome_versioned.interactions_v1` AS i
JOIN `isb-cgc-bq.targetome_versioned.experiments_v1`  AS e
  ON i.`expID` = e.`expID`
WHERE i.`drugID` IN (
  SELECT DISTINCT `drugID`
  FROM `isb-cgc-bq.targetome_versioned.drug_synonyms_v1`
  WHERE LOWER(`synonym`) LIKE '%sorafenib%'
)
  AND e.`exp_assayUnits` = 'nM'
  AND e.`exp_assayValueMedian` <= 100
  AND (e.`exp_assayValueLow`  IS NULL OR e.`exp_assayValueLow`  <= 100)
  AND (e.`exp_assayValueHigh` IS NULL OR e.`exp_assayValueHigh` <= 100)
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
